  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/10/IMG_20211014_103837.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) Ferreter&iacute;a Salvia, en el Raval de Sant Josep, 11 de Onda, te ofrece todo lo necesario para vivir una gran Fira d&#39;Onda: desde paellas y paelleros, hasta vasos, platos y otros utensilios de pl&aacute;stico (hasta final de existencias), mesas, manteles, utensilios grandes de cocina, parrillas o trencillas para asegurar tu &#39;cadafal&#39;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103607.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103636.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103636\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103830.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103837.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103837\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103926.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103949.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_103959.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_103959\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaperafira/img_20211014_104054.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211014_104054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\